sequenceDiagram
    actor Host as Host
    actor Guest as Guest
    participant Lobby as Lobby UI
    participant Server as Game Server
    participant Coord as Game Coordinator

    Host->>Lobby: Open room
    Guest->>Lobby: Join room
    Lobby->>Server: Sync player list

    loop Players choose tank and ready
        Host->>Lobby: Ready
        Guest->>Lobby: Ready
        Lobby->>Server: Update ready state
    end

    alt All ready
        Host->>Server: Start match
        Server->>Coord: Load gameplay scene
        Coord-->>Server: Spawn players and enemies
        Server-->>Host: Replicate world state
        Server-->>Guest: Replicate world state
    else Not ready
        Server-->>Lobby: Keep waiting
    end
